{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9b5cd50c38ac89d5faafc7ec50101e3358cb9c7b2a5c3ea7c9bab4eee03d8b90", "ja": "……ゲーム中に充電が切れそうになったのか。\n同じケーブルがあってよかったよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "e3bdb4f680dbc9db5878c8e9591b8ae7a8136b57afc9ebec05c2d65e9f26a3b9", "ja": "充電セット……たまたま、忘れて……。\nそしたら、急にレイド……思ったより、長引いて……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1006_p", "source_sha256": "5aa1a4974272b3bd95ec7e01c093b0ba63c35d9e2d8f3a45a3f389cad6d033f3", "ja": "そうだったのか。でも、何とかなって良かったよ。\n杏奈が飛び込んできた時は、ちょっと驚いたけどな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "5bc9de8c12636d1af3704c7359f83fb8674a136adf5295b5e2ee1a38697c3f88", "ja": "ごめんなさい、ビックリさせて……\nありがとう……です。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "b278ca03b9c9b2d2cbd922f2bfd4734e088ca0301abcea508f068f0872578c82", "ja": "……{$P$}さん。\nそれ、SNSのアバター……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1009_p", "source_sha256": "dfcc31e305b289871f5d781c6ae33b70aa3a52698f14d54ef3f0eefb517bc687", "ja": "ん？　ああ、これか。そうだよ。\n情報収集用のアカウントのだけどな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "2716055f7020e473df5361ac5006a83a3d1c492e5b8d77ecb96af8671f081b8f", "ja": "初期のまま……なの？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1011_p", "source_sha256": "30b1a6496dd7f2510a4b251a8f2d5bbfc615a648447f190d4d4e70c409b5b80c", "ja": "ああ。投稿を読むだけで交流とかしないから、\n気にしてなかったな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "5dcb23c31cf0e9bb1865d81fc68cdf4c6f51b4c7694257022a781a38ef28037a", "ja": "……杏奈の、使ってないアイテム……あげる。\n送っても……いい？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1013_p", "source_sha256": "24d5f884c2f19912c988d785c40d928e3df0030df882611be38c260339c784b6", "ja": "いいのか？", "zh": "可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "893e8a46fc3afbd38aff102591eb088ab6cbdc1eb3f6f985c6081158d71b0a4c", "ja": "ん……余ってる、から……。\nえっと、アカウント……。待ってて……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "fa34ec9dda6208849251dfde4ff61ebf0eaccdaadd134b59a7bc7aeac014d76b", "ja": "んと……これと、これで……一式。\nあと、これと、これも……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1016_p", "source_sha256": "505962caf09c29d2fe8cd1a519030adcc563d3ce8fae9551d32d20641165639b", "ja": "おお……！？　アイテムがどんどん届いて……\nあっという間にタンスがカラフルに！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "487e67110313ad7a4411fd2cd2eb3105f5ceb0e27c63b8538332b53ae11cf446", "ja": "……これくらい、かな。\n好きなの……使って、ください。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1018_p", "source_sha256": "07f814ec6d22117c4a426ad186697ec6b9f8e99763ded9df48756c757df9396c", "ja": "おお……さっきまで白いTシャツとジーンズだったのが\n一気にオシャレに……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6c1d61c074a93d1764e5a7043d073a7ba2fdfdbef1456b3ffb68576b747de6aa", "ja": "ありがとう、さっそく使ってみるよ。\nえ、このウサ耳なんて、限定アイテムじゃないか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "65e61f4c14549936e927b389e71f2bc54e0e8b4d76ae4f5f9ff12f94c3e33ce7", "ja": "うん……ふたつ、持ってたから……。\nおススメ、です。杏奈とも……おそろい。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0713_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0713_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "07b31a708c3627ef527aa4a0ce251e9b8ac5da81d23adb01c6fab31b1d96090f", "ja": "使ってくれたら、うれしい、な……。\nさっきの、お礼……です♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
